      "id": "claim_8f7084d30fcd425b81c249aeb9189d74",
      "statement": "Before OCM credential transfer, configureOCMForTask calls prepareCredentialTask to verify the task is RUNNING and the ECS Exec agent is ready in the rosa-boundary container; it then marshals only an access token and approved API URL, clears the in-memory token field immediately after marshaling, and zeroes the serialized request buffer in a deferred cleanup after the ECS Exec transfer completes.",
