      "id": "claim_7259b7df17d5436fbd4bb156b46a590d",
      "statement": "Both `credentials configure ocm <task-id>` and `start-task --with-credentials ocm` invoke the same shared configureOCMForTask function, ensuring the CLI entrypoints share one acquire-transfer-install sequence; start-task only triggers it after the task reaches RUNNING and ECS Exec is confirmed ready, to preserve the freshly issued token's useful lifetime.",
